    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100936" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συντᾰγή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>order, command</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ συνταγήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					9(1).717
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Corcyra</span>); of an oracle, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ ς. σωθεὶς χαριστήριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Abh.Berl.Akad.</u>
					1932(5).35
				</span></i>
			 (Pergam.); <i>preconcerted signal</i> in war, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jd.</u>
				20.38
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ συνταγῶν</span>
			<i>at appointed times</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Es.</u>
				10.14
			</span></i>; <i>physician's prescription</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				2.44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> pl.,
				<i>covenant</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				31.185
			</span></i>.</div>
